iple  capacities  he wrote directed and starred in movies  like 2014's the ever after  and 2017's flesh and blood  at the beginning of scott pilgrim vs the  world scott's friends berate him for  dating a much younger girl specifically  a high school student named knives chow  played by ellen wong knives idolizes  scott and can't believe her luck in  dating an older man  well man-child she is absolutely  obsessed with scott but as he starts to  fall for ramona  he pushes knives aside inspiring her  desire for revenge  i'm not talking to you i'm talking to  her  what you broke the heart that broke mine  get ready  long's wide-eyed demeanor and her  previous martial arts training helped  her land the role of knives  and after scott pilgrim she continued  working steadily on the small screen  wong has appeared in several hit  television shows including the carrie  diaries and dark matter  eventually landing a recurring role with  netflix on their original series globe  long played the role of jenny who  wrestles under the moniker fortune  cookie  scott pilgrim vs the world is full of  hilarious supporting players  few of whom are quite as funny as  michael como  played by nelson franklin como is  absolutely  everywhere from the party where scott  first meets ramona to the chaos theater  during scott and gideon's final  battle and no matter where he is he can  be heard in the background making some  sort of obnoxious comment  you know so i told him you've got a  really good sound and i think that you  should market your sound  to deaf people franklin tends to pop up  in television  and film projects as a utilitarian  comedic actor though  television is where you've most likely  noticed him he's appeared in recurring  roles on some of the best comedies of  the last several years including the  office  veep new girl and blackish and was part  of the main cast on shows such as the  millers  and abby's before scott even learns  about ramona's seven evil x's he attends  a bat